    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "text": "——————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安靜的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_362_1",
      "text": "（低聲）快戴上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愉快的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_363_1",
      "text": "我、不是，你，小妹妹，你，你弄錯了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "text": "拉特蘭竟然混進了薩卡茲......你們的目標也是塞茜莉亞嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "text": "怎麼回事，艾澤爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "text": "......菲亞梅塔小姐，這個人，是薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但還有一句話，我絕不能說。"
